# Local web configuration. Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill real values.
# Only server-side names are required. No database credentials or session
# secrets belong in NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables.
#
# AEQUITAS_API_URL: server-side base URL the Next.js BFF uses to reach FastAPI
# (e.g. http://127.0.0.1:8000 locally, the Render service URL in production).
# AEQUITAS_API_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AEQUITAS_API_URL=
